<article class="env-lemma" id="05A6">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05A6">Lemma <span data-tag="05A6">10.95.3</span>.</a> Let $R \to S$ be a faithfully flat ring map. Let $M$ be an $R$-module. If the $S$-module $M \otimes _ R S$ is countably generated and projective, then $M$ is countably generated and projective. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemmas <a href="/tag/03C4" data-tag="03C4">10.83.2</a>, <a href="/tag/05A5" data-tag="05A5">10.95.1</a>, and <a href="/tag/0GVD" data-tag="0GVD">10.95.2</a> and Theorem <a href="/tag/059Z" data-tag="059Z">10.93.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>